{"lines": ["Vienna, 1917. Doctors meet patients awake but frozen like living statues. Speechless. Motionless.", "Within ten years it sweeps the world. Over a million fall ill. Over five hundred thousand die.", "Most survivors never fully recover.", "Then, in 1927, it stops. No cure. No known cause. It just vanishes.", "Doctors blame Spanish flu. But tests on preserved nineteen twenties brain tissue find no flu virus.", "In 2004, doctors find strep bacteria in every new patient, and an immune system attacking the brain.", "In 2012, an enterovirus turns up in the old tissue.", "Flu, strep, a virus, or a body turning on itself? Officially, the cause is still unknown.", "What do you think woke it, and why did it stop? Tell me below."], "words": [["Vienna,", 0.0, 0.18], ["1917.", 0.18, 1.16], ["Doctors", 2.1, 2.58], ["meet", 2.58, 2.94], ["patients", 2.94, 3.4], ["awake", 3.4, 3.72], ["but", 4.12, 4.18], ["frozen", 4.18, 4.44], ["like", 4.44, 4.86], ["living", 4.86, 5.12], ["statues.", 5.12, 5.5], ["Speechless.", 6.04, 6.88], ["Motionless.", 7.26, 7.86], ["Within", 8.464, 8.54], ["ten", 8.54, 8.86], ["years", 8.86, 9.16], ["it", 9.16, 9.54], ["sweeps", 9.54, 9.74], ["the", 9.74, 10.1], ["world.", 10.1, 10.34], ["Over", 11.1, 11.14], ["a", 11.14, 11.28], ["million", 11.28, 11.6], ["fall", 11.6, 11.96], ["ill.", 11.96, 12.38], ["Over", 12.86, 13.0], ["five", 13.0, 13.269], ["hundred", 13.269, 13.741], ["thousand", 13.741, 14.28], ["die.", 14.28, 14.6], ["Most", 15.137, 15.32], ["survivors", 15.32, 15.78], ["never", 15.78, 16.64], ["fully", 16.64, 17.1], ["recover.", 17.1, 17.5], ["Then,", 18.267, 18.4], ["in", 18.4, 18.66], ["1927,", 18.66, 19.3], ["it", 19.42, 20.3], ["stops.", 20.3, 20.52], ["No", 21.36, 21.52], ["cure.", 21.52, 21.78], ["No", 22.3, 22.38], ["known", 22.38, 22.66], ["cause.", 22.66, 23.02], ["It", 23.02, 23.62], ["just", 23.62, 23.78], ["vanishes.", 23.78, 24.22], ["Doctors", 24.893, 25.2], ["blame", 25.2, 25.52], ["Spanish", 25.52, 26.16], ["flu.", 26.1